# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repo-hygiene pass (2026-09-16): committed runtime state / tooling artifacts
# Untracked via `git rm --cached`; these rules stop recurrence.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Zero-byte scratch files some toolchains drop at the repo root.
/_tmp_*
# Root-level agent memory (war-room persistence). Runtime state, not source —
# `.dockerignore` already excludes it from images.
/memory/
# AI coding-tool skill lockfile (local tooling artifact, not part of the product)
/skills-lock.json
# Topology calibration output written by benchmark runs (runtime measurement data)
/.commander/topology-calibration.json

# apps/api is `"type": "module"`, so CommonJS tests must use the .cjs extension.
# A `.js` file here is treated as ESM and its `require()` calls throw at runtime;
# the working CommonJS copies live alongside as .cjs. Ignore stray .js twins.
# (Depth-limited on purpose: apps/api/test/_helpers/spawnServer.js is a real,
#  tracked CommonJS helper — that directory opts out via its own package.json.)
apps/api/test/*.js
